<!-- OVERVIEW -->
<div class="section-label">Overview</div>
<div class="section-title">What Is the Signia Warranty Extension?</div>
<div class="card">
<p>The <strong>Signia Hearing Aid Warranty Extension</strong> adds <strong>12 more months of coverage</strong> to the end of a customer's <strong>current</strong> Signia warranty. It's a <strong>$299 one-time payment</strong> ($250 with code <code>JDSKXDH</code>), sold as a digital product in GHL Payments.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Who qualifies:</strong> genuine Signia hearing aids that are <strong>currently under warranty</strong>. That includes the original warranty, or the 6-month repair warranty after a Signia repair.</li>
<li><strong>Repairs</strong> during coverage are covered at no extra cost.</li>
<li><strong>Lost hearing aids</strong> during coverage are replaced for a <strong>$299 fee per aid</strong>.</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin-top:12px;">After checkout, the customer is sent straight to the registration page, <a href="https://hearingbenefitservices.com/signia-warranty-registration" target="_blank">hearingbenefitservices.com/signia-warranty-registration</a>, where they enter their hearing aid model and serial numbers. Three connected workflows handle everything else. Len steps in to confirm the warranty, order the extension from Signia and record the new expiration date.</p>
<div class="flow">
<span class="box a">Customer buys</span><span class="arrow">→</span>
<span class="box a">Submits registration form</span><span class="arrow">→</span>
<span class="box m">Len confirms still in warranty</span><span class="arrow">→</span>
<span class="box m">Len orders in Signia</span><span class="arrow">→</span>
<span class="box m">Len enters Warranty End Date</span><span class="arrow">→</span>
<span class="box m">Len moves card to Coverage Active</span><span class="arrow">→</span>
<span class="box a">Customer notified · Won</span>
</div>
<p style="margin-top:14px;font-size:0.85rem;">Product page: <a href="https://hearingbenefitservices.com/signia-hearing-aid-warranty-extension/product/signiaextendedwarranty" target="_blank">hearingbenefitservices.com/signia-hearing-aid-warranty-extension/product/signiaextendedwarranty</a></p>
</div>

